    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "禍々しい魔力を放つ装飾、甘美なる円形の供物や\n煌々と輝く糧の数々……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
